# 行尾与二进制策略
# 背景：本机 core.autocrlf=true，Windows 上检出会把 LF 转成 CRLF。
#       shell 脚本一旦变成 CRLF，在 Linux/bash 下会报 $'\r' 错误，因此强制 LF。

# shell 脚本：仓库内存 LF，任何平台检出都是 LF
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf

# PowerShell 脚本：CRLF 是 Windows 惯例（PowerShell 5.1 对 LF 也兼容）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 明确按二进制处理，避免被行尾转换破坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.onnx binary
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.sqlite binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
*.jar binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary
*.flac binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
